cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PALMPaint in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PALMPaint"
abstract: >-
  PALMPaint is a pixel-painting tool for creating and editing static drivers
  for the PALM model system. Buildings, trees, streets and water are painted
  on a grid, and existing static drivers can be loaded, checked against
  PALM's rules and edited.
authors:
  - given-names: Pierre
    family-names: Lampe
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-2849-5778"
version: "0.6.0"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/pimonte/PALMPaint"
keywords:
  - PALM
  - large-eddy simulation
  - static driver
  - urban climate
  - NetCDF
